    "text": "SEC to Review Biden-Era Rules Imposed on SPACs\nBy PYMNTS,\n11 hours agoSecurities and Exchange Commission (SEC) Chairman Paul Atkins said Wednesday (July 2) that the agency will review some of the more recent rules it imposed on special purpose acquisition companies (SPACs). “There have been new rules adopted by the commission in the last couple of years regarding SPACs,” Atkins said...",
